{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54414","headline":"笔峰 · 郑谷","name":"笔峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"似笔挺然秀，山川亦好文。\n宕渠花里发，秦壠竹间分。\n石臼生春水，香龛积暮云。\n道经难久住，日後忆离羣。\n（见民国十七年刊曾瀛藻纂《大竹县志》卷十四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}